Feature Flag Evaluation Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant SDK
    participant Server
    participant Database

    SDK->>Server: POST /flags/evaluate
    Server->>Server: Parse request (person_id, flag_name)

    Server->>Database: SELECT flag BY name
    Database-->>Server: FeatureFlag (enabled, conditions)

    Server->>Server: Evaluate conditions:
    Note over Server: - Rollout percentage<br/>- Person whitelist<br/>- Attribute targeting

    Server->>Database: SELECT person BY id
    Database-->>Server: Person (attributes)

    Server->>Server: Check matches:
    Note over Server: - Is person in whitelist?<br/>- Within rollout %?<br/>- Attributes match?

    Server-->>SDK: { enabled: bool, reason: string }
    SDK->>SDK: Enable/disable feature